          "ruleId": "sunset/sql_injection",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "058_05.php 登录查询 username 参数 SQL 注入（CWE-89）\n\n攻击者通过 HTTP 请求的 query 参数 `username`（058_05.php:25 读取）提交任意字符串。该值未经转义直接拼接进 SQL 语句：058_05.php:30 `$sql = \"select count(*) from users where username='$username'\";`，随后在 058_05.php:31 交给 `mysql_query($sql)` 执行。代码中未见 mysql_real_escape_string、addslashes、预处理语句或类型强制转换，单引号闭合即可改变查询语义，因此校验无效。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "058_05.php"
                },
                "region": {
