          "ruleId": "sunset/sql_injection",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "058_08.php 修改口令 UPDATE 语句 current_password 拼接 SQL 注入（CWE-89）\n\n攻击者通过 query 参数 `current_password`（058_08.php:32 读取，$pass/$username 同源）提交输入。058_08.php:38 直接拼接：`$sql = \"UPDATE users SET PASSWORD='$pass' where username='$username' and password='$curr_pass' \";`，058_08.php:39 由 `mysql_query($sql)` 执行。无转义、无预处理，单引号闭合即可改变 WHERE 条件或追加语句。"
          },
